    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/38ee1985b6aaabb97269b75d7cc0eaf5.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeatBo is a sidescroller rhythm platformer,\u00a0where everything follows the beat of the music!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/e30c41ebd4d8364aad28e24d8cffafc0.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Each level brings a different and refreshing palette to play with, and\u00a0introduce a brand new mechanic to spice up the gameplay!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/58da7b9a423288fd38692a568caae589.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with two different Voxel characters!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/38ee1985b6aaabb97269b75d7cc0eaf5.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BeatBo is a sidescroller rhythm platformer,\u00a0where everything follows the beat of the music!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/e30c41ebd4d8364aad28e24d8cffafc0.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Each level brings a different and refreshing palette to play with, and\u00a0introduce a brand new mechanic to spice up the gameplay!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794920/extras/58da7b9a423288fd38692a568caae589.avif?t=1754629414\" data-has-big width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with two different Voxel characters!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "BeatBo is a sidescroller rhythm platformer, where everything follows the beat of the music, with every level bringing a different and refreshing twist to rhythm platforming!\u00a0 Follow the music, unleash your abilities to the beat with Brio and Oliy to save Rhythm City!\u00a0",
